7	I think you have potential. Why don't you stay and train with us?
8	The grace you bring to battle is fabulous.Oh… I'm so fortunate to have found POKéMON.
9	I came to this GYM because JUAN praised me for my darling POKéMON.Oh, if only I'd met JUAN years ago when I was younger…
